      "content": "To shift the narrative, focus heavily on the qualitative benefits and the resilience you fostered, rather than just the percentage gain. Describe the 5% as evidence of successful establishment in a particular high-stress zone, highlighting how you successfully navigated unique environmental obstacles. You can then conclude by asserting that this foundational success validates your proprietary methodology, positioning the project as a critical, successful proof-of-concept for future, larger-scale targets.",
